###

### 🟢 GET contacts (READ ONLY - WYMAGA TOKENA)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 🟢 POST create (SALES ACCESS - WYMAGA TOKENA)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "email": "jan@test.pl",
  "phone": "123456789",
  "gender": 0,
  "status": 0,
  "employerId": null,
  "address": {
    "street": "Testowa 1",
    "city": "Warszawa",
    "postalCode": "00-001",
    "country": "PL",
    "type": 0
  }
}

###

### 🔎 GET by ID
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ✏️ PUT update
PUT {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{id}}",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "email": "adam@wsei.edu.pl",
  "phone": "123456789"
}

